+---
+id: task-001-rental-service-equipment-quote-book
+type: task
+title: "Rental service: equipment, quote, book"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented `createRentalService()` in `src/index.ts` (in-memory): `addEquipment`, `quote`, `book`.
+
+- Money is integer cents; times are ISO-8601 UTC midnights; periods are `[start, end)`.
+- `quote`/`book` throw on unknown items and on periods that are not whole UTC days (non-midnight,
+  non-UTC, unparsable, empty or reversed). `book` also throws on overlap with an existing booking of the
+  same item.
+- Cancellation is deliberately not implemented; its policy (no refund under 24h before start, otherwise
+  full refund) is left for a later task.
+- Tests in `src/index.test.ts`, written first (red, then green), run with `npm test`.
